<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.1;net8.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <SignAssembly>False</SignAssembly>
    <Title>Net.Code.ADONet</Title>
    <Copyright>Copyright Jeroen Haegebaert</Copyright>
    <Description>ADO.Net helper library. Provides a fluent interface to throw some SQL or DDL at your database.</Description>
    <Authors>Jeroen Haegebaert</Authors>
    <Company></Company>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/jhgbrt/yadal/wiki</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/jhgbrt/yadal</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>ado.net</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
7.0.0
Breaking:
- Depends on Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7. Entra ID (Azure AD) authentication now requires referencing Microsoft.Data.SqlClient.Extensions.Azure in your application.
New:
- net8.0 target (in addition to netstandard2.1).
- DateOnly/TimeOnly support, including Npgsql 10, which returns DateOnly/TimeOnly for date/time columns.
- IDataRecord extensions: GetDateOnly, GetTimeOnly, GetTimeSpan, GetDateTimeOffset, GetByteArray, GetEnum.
- Source generator: DateOnly, TimeOnly, TimeSpan, DateTimeOffset, byte[] and enum properties; error ADONET001 for unsupported property types.
Fixed:
- Mapping a type with a public property with a non-public setter or getter threw NullReferenceException.
- Generated mappers cached column ordinals across queries and did not map DBNull to null for nullable reference types.
- Record constructor mapping conversions, enum conversion, SelectOne key handling, WithParameters with runtime types, chunked GetBytes/GetChars, thread-safety of the query cache.
- Patched vulnerable transitive dependencies (System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs, Microsoft.Bcl.Memory).
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <Version>7.0.0</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>7.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>7.0.0</FileVersion>
    <LangVersion>preview</LangVersion>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild>true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Data.SqlClient" Version="7.1.1" />
    <!-- Microsoft.Data.SqlClient (up to 7.1.1) depends on System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs versions affected by
         CVE-2026-84008 / CVE-2026-70162; reference a patched version until it does so itself -->
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs" Version="10.0.14" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.14" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Linq.Async" Version="7.0.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="10.0.403" PrivateAssets="All" />
    <None Include="..\Net.Code.ADONet.SourceGenerators\bin\$(Configuration)\netstandard2.0\Net.Code.ADONet.SourceGenerators.dll" Pack="true" PackagePath="analyzers/dotnet/cs" Visible="false" />
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CSharp" Version="4.7.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.ComponentModel.Annotations" Version="5.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces" Version="10.0.14" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>